{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0044_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ef50c7dda94fa31df34d983aba13aaac071f56ca37d841c4edfb5533ac06ede0", "ja": "（今日のライブのテーマは、宇宙。リハーサル前、\n紗代子に、屋上に付き合ってほしいと言われたが……）", "zh": "（今天演唱会的主题是宇宙。\n排练前，纱代子要我陪她到屋顶上……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0044_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "96bab44e2eeb3d937a4772fcb9c0a3296193586e44c3f39f4d4a8e30364aabdc", "ja": "やっぱり、星は見えないか……。", "zh": "果然看不到星星……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0044_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d65d05bc707fd7cf5aa6a4e90594e1bc3e62d20bfc287d79b179c4fe6c72cb57", "ja": "紗代子。空を見上げたりして、どうしたんだ？\nまだ昼間だぞ。", "zh": "纱代子，你抬头看天空做什么？\n现在还是白天喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0044_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "1522740de5388e2be472fdca0479b250e860fa27f44bb8f24432028228532725", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。\nふふっ、変に思いましたか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n呵呵，你觉得很纳闷吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0044_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "3f88e99f57793bbc31db20871526c9c498eb0f48eafa68fe35bf471d1e731d9a", "ja": "昼間は見えづらいだけで、星は空にあるんです。\n目がいい人には、ちゃんと見えたりするらしいですよ。", "zh": "虽然白天看不太到，但天上依旧有星星。\n听说视力好的人就能看得一清二楚呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0044_1005_p", "source_sha256": "47f6377d84c13a9e6a6fa764e1b6890f2480d6a6bad163089d341e68634c2f90", "ja": "へえ、そうだったのか。", "zh": "喔～原来是这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0044_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "2bfadd5cf38e8781f822413624df0293f914f159086526b79be373c39dda11da", "ja": "はい。なので、もしかしたら\n私にも見えないかな……と思って。", "zh": "是啊。所以，我原本在想自己是不是\n也看得到……就上来试试看了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0044_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "cba68ccd78f6c7575037203ab34d9fff21ddd5283ff3c2e7ad0edc9bc1201c94", "ja": "でもやっぱり、私の視力が悪いせいかな？\n自分では、見つけられませんでした。", "zh": "可惜，大概是视力太差吧，\n我果然看不见白天的星星。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0044_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "ea4356bb4e427c1d02ba8636dfb6c2702905cbaa8a9a0a9755ab09fc819d0b0b", "ja": "星って、なんだかアイドルみたいですよね。\n手を伸ばしても、簡単には届かなくて……。", "zh": "感觉星星就像偶像一样呢。\n就算伸出手也没办法轻易碰到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0044_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "40407594cd19ef0112374ee5cb788ae44f931b865ba59f4c991b8cb20dadc57a", "ja": "私の手じゃ届かないかもしれないのに、\n努力することがやめられないんです。", "zh": "明知道自己的手可能碰不着，\n但还是无法放弃努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0044_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b12e7c9faa954bf5c66343bfd7d1ff3258dcf4157949d341ccd45ba00b920596", "ja": "いや。俺にはしっかりと、星が見えるよ。", "zh": "不，我可是清楚地看到星星了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0044_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "a907b35eb1296b073475dfe2e83fba95283d860e0e4c56b5f85139dc8a5ac78b", "ja": "え！？　ほ、本当ですか？", "zh": "什么！？真、真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0044_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d171ed884d150d3c9a8adb00c7da09c29b7369843e74bd8de61d1891980a0a5f", "ja": "もちろん。\n俺の目の前に、ちゃんといるじゃないか。", "zh": "当然。\n那颗星星就在我眼前啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0044_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "817a056ab8c5bf51b67f149053cc29debd72cfd2a6ce5d69b0ebd04cbcce8c6e", "ja": "{$P$}、それって……。", "zh": "{$P$}，你是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0044_1014_p", "source_sha256": "107df0c4936bbebbd6865f66426efdcaa3de7292375b350c084f2649d6d8f55b", "ja": "紗代子自身の輝きが、自分では\nまだ見えてないかもしれないけどな。", "zh": "纱代子，\n或许你现在还看不见自己的光芒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0044_1015_p", "source_sha256": "7a26846afcd26028170891c83ca27f3f2aac9b49abd6c4e9d383d61d8d01f707", "ja": "俺がプロデューサーとして、トップアイドルまで導く。\nだから今日のライブも、これからも、一緒に頑張ろう。", "zh": "但我身为制作人，会带着你成为顶尖偶像。\n所以今天的演唱会、接下来的日子，我们都要一起奋斗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0044_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "c6cfd3007173db1dee87ceb772a22c6f34c5ce0f660050abf8e5c219af016709", "ja": "{$P$}……はい！\n私、頑張ります！", "zh": "{$P$}……好的！\n我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0044_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "c16fc2a9595606d21c37e0ff32f1a6b74bb2a0174ccca0c158da6200a57440a1", "ja": "トップになるまで……絶対に諦めませんからね！", "zh": "在我成为顶尖偶像之前……绝对不会放弃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
